There's exactly four groups of people in this world. 

There's people who think other people can be split into 2 groups. 

There's people who think other people can be split into 3 groups. 

There's people who know that other people can't be split into groups at all. 

And there's people who refuse to take a side because they don't agree on the definition of "people", "split", and/or "groups".
